  <h3 class="h3 text-grey1 mosaic-heading mosaic-heading--standard" style="background-color: ; color: " tabindex="0">
      <a href="/child-rights-convention/how-convention-works" title="How the Convention on the Rights of the Child works" data-action="/child-rights-convention/how-convention-works" data-tracked-component="cta" data-bound="click" data-label="How the Convention on the Rights of the Child works">How the Convention on the Rights of the Child works</a>
  </h3>

                           <span tabindex="0">
            <p class="card-description text-small white-bg text-grey1">
  Joining, implementing and monitoring the world&rsquo;s most widely ratified human rights treaty
</p>
