  <h3 class="h3 text-grey1 mosaic-heading mosaic-heading--standard" style="background-color: ; color: " tabindex="0">
      <a href="/stories/child-rights-convention-faq" title="Your questions on the CRC answered" data-action="/stories/child-rights-convention-faq" data-tracked-component="cta" data-bound="click" data-label="Your questions on the CRC answered">Your questions on the CRC answered</a>
  </h3>

                           <span tabindex="0">
            <p class="card-description text-small white-bg text-grey1">
  How many countries have ratified the Convention on the Rights of the Child? How does the Convention define "child"?
</p>
