          <p tabindex="0">UNICEF strives to uphold the rights of every child, protecting them from harm and all forms of discrimination, so that they can grow up healthy and educated to reach their full potential. This work is in line with UNICEF&rsquo;s globally recognized mandate and its support of national priorities.</p>
    
